qlqz7mHuD48cA9qjzMnzyoHi97v_JimuLpFNMXQX1JZCiR2RHiBG0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSJcgUD56zeKz7DDOXR5XSW8vVlUlb6V54H4zyMVZOAQg&oe=6B0855C0"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "SGVRTrailerCover.png", "id": "1489970458990826", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499314641_1489970465657492_5101885299613120494_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3kEZmGwtUgMQ7kNvwFTyz5b&_nc_oc=AdqvZ-5f80wHxFbfY22ck0ZkSnZBma90oa6IiLavUpQSoVr9sdQZ-_0n7AQ9B-GSeGE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSqYrRStghPgp4ITYgmcD3E3hhhPwUwwRUjcOnUnquZ6w&oe=6B0850DD"}, "display_name": "Singularity VR", "keywords": ["SGVR", "SingularityVR", "ClimberspaceStudios", "singularity"], "long_description": "\nExplore the Singularity.\n\nDeveloped by Yoda's Gaming Galaxy and Climberspace Studios, Singularity VR is a virtual reality experience designed to push the boundaries of immersive gaming. Whether you are stepping into a virtual world for the first time or you are a seasoned VR veteran, this game delivers a gripping, unforgettable experience built from the ground up for modern VR hardware.\n\nWe wanted to create something that feels as incredible to play as it looks. Through a passionate collaboration between our two studios, we have crafted a world that responds to your every move, drawing you deeper into the gameplay with every session.\n\nKey Features:\n\nBuilt for Immersion: Experience fluid controls, stunning visuals, and a world designed entirely around the unique strengths of virtual reality.\n\nA True Collaboration: Brought to life by the combined creative vision and technical expertise of Yoda's Gaming Galaxy and Climberspace Studios.\n\nEngaging Gameplay: Engage in competitive movement-based combat, or if you prefer a more relaxed pace, enjoy the atmosphere of Sector 1. Explore the vastness of space to experience true", "short_descript